WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.240 --> 01:38.000
=Episode 29=

01:38.760 --> 01:39.799
How long are you going

01:42.799 --> 01:44.439
to keep up this little show?

01:50.840 --> 01:52.879
Mother has barely been laid to rest,

01:56.280 --> 01:58.359
and already you're so eager

01:59.319 --> 02:01.480
to squeeze
every last bit of use out of her,

02:04.359 --> 02:06.239
just as you did to Grandmother.

02:08.360 --> 02:09.919
I truly felt for

02:09.919 --> 02:11.599
and miss your mother.

02:12.919 --> 02:13.520
Everyone,

02:14.680 --> 02:15.639
(In Memoriam)
please go back.

02:18.039 --> 02:19.080
As for the funeral,

02:20.000 --> 02:21.439
the Fu family will make
the arrangements.

02:22.439 --> 02:24.800
My condolences, Commander Zhao.

02:38.919 --> 02:40.400
When I got married,

02:41.520 --> 02:43.080
Mother was still fine.

02:45.319 --> 02:46.599
How could she suddenly...?

02:46.879 --> 02:48.039
I didn't tell you

02:48.879 --> 02:51.199
because I was afraid
you'd blame yourself.

02:53.360 --> 02:54.360
Your mother

02:55.039 --> 02:56.360
had always been

02:56.599 --> 02:57.879
in poor health.

02:58.400 --> 02:59.599
She feared she wouldn't last,

03:00.560 --> 03:02.400
and that her funeral
would delay your wedding.

03:03.039 --> 03:04.039
Seeing you married,

03:05.240 --> 03:06.400
she was finally at peace.

03:07.599 --> 03:08.800
And then...

03:11.240 --> 03:12.280
she couldn't hold on any longer.

03:17.439 --> 03:19.479
Father and Mother often argued.

03:20.439 --> 03:21.759
Mother could never win against him,

03:21.879 --> 03:22.879
so she kept all that distress
bottled up,

03:24.159 --> 03:26.280
and took a lot of medicine
to calm her nerves.

03:27.879 --> 03:29.199
I thought she'd be all right.

03:29.800 --> 03:31.199
I failed to take proper care of her.

03:34.479 --> 03:36.240
Let's stop arguing over this.

03:38.520 --> 03:39.919
Who's right or wrong

03:40.960 --> 03:41.800
doesn't matter.

03:42.840 --> 03:44.039
What matters now

03:45.479 --> 03:47.520
is giving your mother a proper funeral

03:48.800 --> 03:50.479
and a dignified send-off.

03:52.240 --> 03:53.240
I've decided

03:54.400 --> 03:56.039
to build a mourning hut here

03:56.800 --> 03:58.120
and mourn my late wife.

03:58.919 --> 04:00.599
I failed her while she was alive.

04:01.080 --> 04:01.919
Now that she's gone,

04:03.840 --> 04:05.039
I won't fail her again.

04:10.759 --> 04:12.479
Mother's true last wish

04:13.960 --> 04:15.520
was to return home after death,

04:16.399 --> 04:17.759
back to her roots.

04:20.600 --> 04:22.199
I will take her coffin

04:23.360 --> 04:24.680
back to the Xie family in Jiangnan.

04:24.680 --> 04:25.160
Enough.

04:25.560 --> 04:27.399
You are no longer part of the Fu family.

04:27.560 --> 04:28.879
What right do you have
to meddle in our affairs?

04:28.879 --> 04:29.680
What about me?

04:30.560 --> 04:32.279
I'm a daughter-in-law of the Fu family.

04:32.639 --> 04:34.480
Do I have the right to decide
for Mother?

04:34.480 --> 04:35.079
Don't you dare!

04:38.120 --> 04:40.360
Don't think that just because someone
powerful backs you

04:41.360 --> 04:42.959
means you can defy me.

04:43.800 --> 04:46.800
After everything the Fu family
has done for you! Ungrateful wretches!

04:50.040 --> 04:51.240
I gave this life of mine

04:53.160 --> 04:55.079
back to the Fu family long ago

04:55.079 --> 04:56.279
at Biyun Nunnery.

04:57.360 --> 04:58.199
Today,

04:59.199 --> 05:01.279
you can talk until you are blue
in the face,

05:01.879 --> 05:04.639
but I will still take Mother back
to the Xie family in Jiangnan!

05:04.639 --> 05:06.199
You dare defy me!

05:07.439 --> 05:08.120
You...

05:18.120 --> 05:20.000
It wasn't enough that you drove Mother
to her death.

05:21.160 --> 05:23.680
Now you want to use her death
to polish your own reputation?

05:25.560 --> 05:26.199
Fine.

05:27.959 --> 05:29.240
From this day forward,

05:29.959 --> 05:31.560
our ties are severed!

05:32.279 --> 05:34.240
You can keep your empty grave

05:34.240 --> 05:35.439
and fend for yourself!

05:35.439 --> 05:37.319
Live out the rest of your life
however you please!

05:37.399 --> 05:38.079
Fine!

05:39.279 --> 05:40.800
Fu Tingyun, listen to me.

05:41.279 --> 05:42.160
Your mother

05:42.160 --> 05:43.319
belonged to the Fu family in life

05:43.319 --> 05:44.600
and she remains one in death!

05:45.680 --> 05:46.920
She'll be buried

05:46.920 --> 05:48.040
wherever I say she will!

05:50.759 --> 05:51.800
I'll burn her body right now!

05:51.800 --> 05:52.560
Mother!

05:55.120 --> 05:56.360
Mother!

06:00.480 --> 06:01.240
Mother!

06:13.079 --> 06:14.839
I don't want Mother

06:16.639 --> 06:18.360
to remain here another day.

06:19.680 --> 06:20.920
I've already asked Uncle

06:23.040 --> 06:24.680
to make arrangements in Jiangnan.

06:27.439 --> 06:28.639
As soon as the documents arrive,

06:29.439 --> 06:30.639
I'll take Mother

06:31.959 --> 06:33.480
back to Jiangnan.

06:36.480 --> 06:37.399
Mother,

06:38.560 --> 06:40.040
from now on,

06:42.439 --> 06:45.120
you no longer have to be
the Fu family's dutiful wife.

06:46.600 --> 06:48.600
You can be once again

06:48.800 --> 06:50.680
the carefree young lady you were
in the Xie family.

06:52.920 --> 06:55.920
♪Lone wild geese know not
late autumn's woes♪

06:56.480 --> 07:00.439
♪If heaven's will, none can implore♪

07:00.439 --> 07:02.160
The Fu family's ancestral home
is in Huaying,

07:02.240 --> 07:04.120
west of the capital.

07:04.439 --> 07:06.360
Yet Fifth Madam Fu's coffin

07:06.360 --> 07:08.000
is being carried south.

07:08.480 --> 07:10.279
Fifth Madam Fu left a final wish:

07:10.279 --> 07:11.879
never to be buried
in the Fu family graveyard

07:11.959 --> 07:13.439
or beside her husband.

07:13.680 --> 07:15.199
So her coffin is being taken south,

07:15.199 --> 07:16.560
back to the Xie family in Jiangnan.

07:17.199 --> 07:19.040
Fifth Master Fu prides himself
on his filial devotion,

07:19.160 --> 07:20.000
yet both his children

07:20.000 --> 07:21.519
honor their mother and not their father.

07:21.600 --> 07:22.879
That tells you

07:23.040 --> 07:24.800
what awful things he must've done
behind closed doors.

07:27.960 --> 07:28.879
I'm planning

07:29.240 --> 07:31.000
to return to Huaying
and join your brother.

07:31.800 --> 07:32.800
Father refuses

07:32.800 --> 07:33.920
to leave the capital.

07:34.639 --> 07:35.879
If he causes you any trouble,

07:35.959 --> 07:36.879
write to me.

07:36.879 --> 07:38.240
I'll ask the clan elders to step in

07:38.240 --> 07:39.120
and speak up for you.

07:40.480 --> 07:42.439
You fulfilled Mother's final wish

07:43.240 --> 07:44.560
and took her back to Jiangnan.

07:45.680 --> 07:47.480
You've had to endure
plenty of criticism for it.

07:48.399 --> 07:49.279
You've been through a lot.

07:57.519 --> 07:58.839
Your Majesty,

07:59.279 --> 08:01.399
at his wedding banquet, Commander Zhao

08:01.560 --> 08:03.360
publicly vowed to honor Fifth Madam Fu

08:03.439 --> 08:04.680
as his own mother

08:04.680 --> 08:06.360
and care for her as such.

08:06.439 --> 08:08.439
The story was praised
throughout the capital.

08:08.680 --> 08:10.560
Now that Fifth Madam Fu has passed away,

08:10.639 --> 08:13.240
Commander Zhao has shown
no sign of observing mourning.

08:13.360 --> 08:15.879
If his filial devotion was nothing
but empty words,

08:16.079 --> 08:18.360
the people will surely be disappointed.

08:18.360 --> 08:19.560
With such conduct,

08:19.560 --> 08:21.399
how can he set an example
for the other officials?

08:22.040 --> 08:23.519
I disagree.

08:23.600 --> 08:25.560
It was merely a ceremonial gesture.

08:25.920 --> 08:27.240
Surely he isn't expected
to actually observe mourning.

08:27.480 --> 08:28.639
That would be absurd!

08:33.519 --> 08:34.240
Your Majesty,

08:34.840 --> 08:35.960
I had already intended

08:36.440 --> 08:38.080
to request a hundred days of mourning
in filial duty,

08:39.399 --> 08:40.399
to remain with my wife

08:42.120 --> 08:43.559
and see my mother-in-law off
on her final journey.

08:44.039 --> 08:44.600
Very well.

08:45.279 --> 08:46.320
Your decision, Commander Zhao,

08:46.399 --> 08:47.600
is an act of true filial devotion.

08:47.960 --> 08:48.639
Granted.

08:59.200 --> 09:00.159
Madam Zhao

09:01.200 --> 09:02.840
has been overcome by grief and worry.

09:03.440 --> 09:04.799
She has just lost her mother.

09:07.159 --> 09:08.440
She'll need some time to recover.

09:26.840 --> 09:27.679
Did I wake you?

09:39.240 --> 09:39.600
Here.

09:44.360 --> 09:45.399
Drink your medicine first.

09:49.279 --> 09:50.159
I added

09:50.799 --> 09:52.559
three qian of candied osmanthus
to the medicine.

09:55.600 --> 09:56.360
It won't be bitter.

10:13.559 --> 10:14.799
Why didn't you

10:15.559 --> 10:17.240
attend court today?

10:18.320 --> 10:19.919
Mr. Zhao has set up a memorial hall

10:20.000 --> 10:21.039
for Fifth Madam

10:21.159 --> 10:22.600
and will mourn her for a hundred days.

10:32.120 --> 10:33.240
By custom,

10:33.559 --> 10:34.399
a son-in-law

10:34.919 --> 10:36.799
is not required to mourn
his mother-in-law,

10:38.159 --> 10:40.399
much less take leave
from office and court.

10:42.120 --> 10:43.120
Right now

10:44.080 --> 10:46.440
is the most critical time
in the investigation.

10:47.879 --> 10:48.919
I'm afraid

10:49.519 --> 10:50.879
I'm holding you back.

10:58.200 --> 10:59.080
From now on,

11:00.240 --> 11:01.399
don't ever say you're holding me back.

11:05.000 --> 11:06.320
Mother-in-law treated me
with nothing but kindness.

11:07.240 --> 11:08.440
These hundred days of mourning

11:09.159 --> 11:11.039
are something I willingly chose
to observe.

11:14.360 --> 11:15.519
This isn't about custom.

11:16.679 --> 11:17.960
It's about what feels right.

11:19.759 --> 11:20.559
Besides,

11:20.919 --> 11:22.080
the court is hardly

11:22.480 --> 11:23.440
going to grind to a halt

11:23.440 --> 11:24.000
without me.

11:31.039 --> 11:31.840
Don't worry.

11:33.039 --> 11:33.960
Going through the account books

11:34.879 --> 11:36.000
takes time and effort,

11:37.120 --> 11:38.639
but I've already made arrangements.

11:39.799 --> 11:41.000
Right now,

11:41.519 --> 11:42.519
what matters most to me

11:43.600 --> 11:44.639
is your health.

11:50.879 --> 11:52.039
We'll see

11:55.399 --> 11:56.960
Mother off together.

12:03.679 --> 12:05.120
Are you still feeling unwell?

12:07.240 --> 12:08.080
I'll get a healer.

12:33.960 --> 12:34.840
It's nothing.

12:39.120 --> 12:41.759
I was just thinking about Mother.

12:52.920 --> 12:56.160
(After One Hundred Days of Mourning)

12:57.080 --> 12:59.519
(Ministry of Revenue)

12:59.519 --> 13:00.879
Every entry must be accounted for.

13:00.879 --> 13:01.320
- Yes.
- All right.

13:01.960 --> 13:03.960
(Censorate)

13:03.960 --> 13:04.559
Lord Liu.

13:07.519 --> 13:08.799
There can be no mistakes.

13:08.799 --> 13:09.159
Yes.

13:12.240 --> 13:13.440
Check everything carefully!

13:13.440 --> 13:14.159
Yes.

13:25.680 --> 13:27.640
(Three hundred salt permits
were issued above quota)

13:28.600 --> 13:29.679
Your Majesty,

13:30.279 --> 13:31.639
the Anzhou salt-tax accounts

13:32.000 --> 13:33.120
have been thoroughly investigated.

13:35.039 --> 13:36.000
There are indeed irregularities.

13:37.200 --> 13:38.000
Your Majesty,

13:38.519 --> 13:40.120
the Ministry of Revenue reviewed
six years' worth of account books

13:40.120 --> 13:42.320
(Revere Heaven and Honor the Ancestors)
from regions under the old system.

13:42.320 --> 13:43.200
Upon examination,

13:43.399 --> 13:44.440
the issuing of salt permits,

13:44.679 --> 13:46.440
transport losses, and other entries

13:47.200 --> 13:48.440
are riddled with discrepancies.

13:48.600 --> 13:50.399
In autumn and winter of last year alone,

13:50.480 --> 13:51.639
the shortfall reached

13:52.200 --> 13:53.320
one hundred thousand taels.

13:58.039 --> 13:58.759
Minister Yu,

13:59.120 --> 14:00.240
Anzhou's salt administration

14:00.639 --> 14:02.519
has always been under your supervision.

14:03.879 --> 14:05.480
I did fail in my oversight.

14:05.480 --> 14:06.759
Your Majesty, please punish me.

14:07.639 --> 14:08.399
However...

14:08.840 --> 14:10.039
(Revere Heaven and Honor the Ancestors)
Your Majesty,

14:10.519 --> 14:13.120
the Censorate also examined salt-tax
accounts across the realm

14:13.240 --> 14:14.799
and found discrepancies
in salt-permit figures

14:14.879 --> 14:15.960
and storage losses

14:15.960 --> 14:17.120
to be quite common.

14:17.279 --> 14:19.480
Last year's losses in the three
northwestern garrisons

14:19.480 --> 14:20.799
were even greater

14:20.919 --> 14:22.399
than those in Anzhou.

14:30.320 --> 14:32.440
Why is the Censorate investigating
this too?

14:34.799 --> 14:37.120
You knew the Ministry of Revenue
was investigating Anzhou.

14:38.519 --> 14:40.639
Why didn't we investigate together?

14:46.639 --> 14:48.360
The Censorate acted on its own.

14:48.519 --> 14:50.279
That risks muddying the issue.

14:51.559 --> 14:52.960
If there truly is a shortfall
in the northwest,

14:53.759 --> 14:55.200
I am willing to investigate that
as well.

14:55.200 --> 14:55.799
Enough.

14:56.480 --> 14:57.799
Salt-tax accounts

14:58.440 --> 15:00.080
have always been a mess.

15:00.600 --> 15:02.559
Now you want to dig
through every last one?

15:03.600 --> 15:05.240
Do you think my realm

15:05.879 --> 15:07.159
is too peaceful?

15:07.919 --> 15:09.120
In my humble opinion,

15:09.320 --> 15:10.840
Commander Zhao is examining
the old accounts

15:10.840 --> 15:12.679
only to make up the shortfall.

15:12.679 --> 15:14.240
If we can determine an exact amount,

15:14.840 --> 15:16.120
I am willing

15:17.159 --> 15:18.759
to find a way to raise the funds.

15:21.639 --> 15:22.000
Your Majesty,

15:22.000 --> 15:22.919
reasonable storage losses

15:23.320 --> 15:24.440
have always existed.

15:25.080 --> 15:25.840
That's enough

15:26.200 --> 15:27.200
for today.

15:27.840 --> 15:29.480
The court is dismissed!

15:30.000 --> 15:32.000
We respectfully bid
Your Majesty farewell!

15:35.440 --> 15:36.279
Commander Zhao.

15:41.080 --> 15:43.440
A young man should know when to stop.

15:43.639 --> 15:44.960
Act too recklessly,

15:45.879 --> 15:47.600
and your family may pay the price.

15:48.919 --> 15:50.600
What do you mean by that?

15:50.679 --> 15:52.759
If you hadn't been so determined
to investigate those accounts,

15:53.600 --> 15:54.600
would your mother-in-law

15:56.039 --> 15:59.120
have died so suddenly?

15:59.799 --> 16:01.039
Today,

16:01.759 --> 16:03.440
you are willing to part
with your mother-in-law.

16:04.480 --> 16:05.399
Tomorrow,

16:06.240 --> 16:07.919
who else will you be willing
to part with?

16:21.639 --> 16:22.879
(Please)

16:23.000 --> 16:24.600
(escort her to the capital.)

16:25.320 --> 16:26.960
(I am willing to reward you)

16:27.399 --> 16:28.559
(ten thousand taels of silver)

16:28.759 --> 16:29.879
(for your trouble.)

16:31.320 --> 16:32.879
(My only wish is that the two of you)

16:33.440 --> 16:34.679
(will always be of one heart)

16:35.879 --> 16:37.320
(and weather every storm together.)

16:38.399 --> 16:39.879
(A blessed union.)

16:40.679 --> 16:42.240
(Bound as one forever.)

16:42.960 --> 16:44.440
(A match made in heaven.)

16:45.120 --> 16:46.720
(Together through a hundred years.)

16:47.879 --> 16:49.039
(May you always)

16:49.720 --> 16:50.759
(ride a fine steed)

16:51.360 --> 16:52.440
(and rise to great heights.)

16:54.279 --> 16:55.200
(Thank you, Mother.)

17:19.880 --> 17:22.000
(Renshen-Aconite Life-Saving Decoction)

17:26.079 --> 17:26.960
Who is it?

17:33.799 --> 17:35.880
(If you hadn't been so determined
to investigate those accounts,)

17:36.720 --> 17:37.720
(would your mother-in-law)

17:39.160 --> 17:42.240
(have died so suddenly?)

17:53.680 --> 17:55.119
Do you recognize this prescription?

17:56.440 --> 17:57.279
Commander Zhao,

17:58.200 --> 18:00.000
my eyesight is failing with age.

18:00.240 --> 18:01.240
I can't make it out clearly.

18:01.519 --> 18:02.400
Take another look.

18:02.839 --> 18:04.519
The owner of Rengui Pharmacy
in the neighboring county

18:04.519 --> 18:05.839
said you traveled a great distance

18:06.839 --> 18:08.680
specifically to have
this prescription filled.

18:12.160 --> 18:12.759
(Madam!)

18:13.160 --> 18:14.000
(Madam!)

18:21.359 --> 18:22.200
My wife

18:22.839 --> 18:23.920
was in poor health.

18:24.240 --> 18:25.240
It was to calm her nerves.

18:41.559 --> 18:42.440
What are you doing?

18:42.799 --> 18:43.759
This medicine

18:44.799 --> 18:46.440
was prepared from this
very prescription.

18:47.119 --> 18:48.960
If it's really meant to calm the nerves,

18:49.160 --> 18:50.599
why don't you try it yourself?

18:51.319 --> 18:52.799
You want to kill me?

18:56.079 --> 18:57.039
Zhao Ling.

18:57.440 --> 18:58.519
You don't know who you're dealing with.

18:58.519 --> 18:59.559
You want to kill me?

18:59.680 --> 19:00.440
Do you even know

19:00.440 --> 19:01.880
who's backing me?

19:02.119 --> 19:03.319
You can't afford to cross them!

19:03.319 --> 19:03.960
Who?

19:05.640 --> 19:06.440
The Yu family?

19:07.319 --> 19:08.440
You should be wondering

19:08.599 --> 19:10.240
why I came here tonight,

19:10.440 --> 19:11.440
and who

19:12.119 --> 19:14.400
told me what you've done.

19:15.279 --> 19:16.160
Yu Guodong,

19:16.160 --> 19:18.000
you old scumbag.

19:18.519 --> 19:19.920
You betrayed me.

19:22.559 --> 19:23.200
My son-in-law...

19:25.599 --> 19:26.839
These are all the letters

19:26.839 --> 19:28.400
between the Yu family and me.

19:29.000 --> 19:30.279
Everything I've done wrong...

19:30.279 --> 19:31.640
they made me do it.

19:32.000 --> 19:33.119
And Madam Yu...

19:33.440 --> 19:34.519
she was the one who told me

19:34.519 --> 19:35.440
to have Ms. Li

19:35.440 --> 19:36.160
frame you.

19:36.160 --> 19:37.079
And Xie...

19:37.079 --> 19:38.920
they arranged her death too.

19:38.920 --> 19:39.359
Take them.

19:39.640 --> 19:40.319
They're all yours.

19:40.440 --> 19:42.359
Consider it your father-in-law's love
for you.

19:43.519 --> 19:44.359
Don't!

19:47.440 --> 19:48.480
Even if you threw the letters away,

19:48.599 --> 19:50.000
you also have my confession.

19:50.519 --> 19:52.279
You'll bring them down.

19:52.640 --> 19:53.759
Spare me.

20:02.640 --> 20:04.559
My great son-in-law, please spare me.

20:04.880 --> 20:06.200
If you let me go,

20:06.200 --> 20:08.359
I'll never seek reinstatement again.

20:08.359 --> 20:10.200
I'll just live as a retired old man
of the Fu family.

20:10.200 --> 20:12.359
The Emperor rules through filial piety.

20:12.359 --> 20:13.759
I'll spread word of your filial devotion

20:13.759 --> 20:14.759
throughout the realm!

20:14.759 --> 20:16.599
It will only help your reputation
and career.

20:16.599 --> 20:17.599
I'm begging you!

20:17.599 --> 20:19.039
Please let me go!

20:20.319 --> 20:21.960
If Mother were still alive

20:23.640 --> 20:24.880
and you had brought these out then...

20:26.880 --> 20:29.039
perhaps for Quanhui's sake,

20:30.440 --> 20:31.680
I might have still seen you
as my father-in-law.

20:32.519 --> 20:34.000
But if I accept this now,

20:34.440 --> 20:36.319
what would that mean for her?

20:37.279 --> 20:37.880
Zhao Ling,

20:38.400 --> 20:39.960
you're a fourth-rank official now.

20:39.960 --> 20:41.079
A fourth-rank official.

20:41.400 --> 20:42.839
In five years, you reached

20:42.839 --> 20:45.000
what I couldn't achieve
in my entire life.

20:45.240 --> 20:47.839
Are you willing to throw away
such a promising future?

20:47.839 --> 20:49.000
Please spare me!

20:49.000 --> 20:50.079
According to you,

20:51.519 --> 20:52.839
this bowl of medicine...

20:55.920 --> 20:57.759
is just for calming the nerves.

20:58.480 --> 21:00.200
I don't want anything anymore!

21:00.559 --> 21:02.480
Please let me go!

21:02.480 --> 21:03.559
Zhao Ling!

21:03.759 --> 21:05.319
Even if I am a heartless wretch,

21:05.440 --> 21:07.279
I am still Fu Tingyun's birth father!

21:07.480 --> 21:09.599
You two will pay for this!

21:11.079 --> 21:12.240
I'll bear...

21:15.599 --> 21:17.000
the consequences myself.

21:24.920 --> 21:25.799
I am

21:27.640 --> 21:29.440
the consequence you deserve.

21:31.680 --> 21:32.920
I don't want anything.

21:33.079 --> 21:34.440
Please, let me go.

21:35.599 --> 21:37.200
Please, let me go!

22:04.720 --> 22:08.800
(Yunshe Hut)

22:13.440 --> 22:14.559
Clean everything up.

22:15.960 --> 22:17.079
Leave no loose ends.

22:19.400 --> 22:20.519
Don't let them get anything on us.

22:21.559 --> 22:22.079
Yes.

22:43.759 --> 22:44.519
Madam,

22:45.480 --> 22:47.160
servants from Fifth Master Fu's
household

22:47.160 --> 22:48.480
say they have an urgent matter

22:48.720 --> 22:49.519
and wish to see you.

22:52.000 --> 22:53.279
Let them in.

22:55.240 --> 22:56.039
Come in.

22:58.519 --> 22:59.400
Ninth Young Lady.

22:59.960 --> 23:01.440
Something happened to the Fu family.

23:02.839 --> 23:03.759
Please,

23:04.200 --> 23:06.160
you must tell us what to do.

23:09.440 --> 23:11.079
The day Mother's coffin was taken away,

23:11.599 --> 23:12.680
I made it clear

23:13.880 --> 23:15.440
that I had severed all ties
with Fifth Master.

23:15.960 --> 23:17.799
I was no longer part of the Fu family.

23:19.079 --> 23:21.000
What happened this time

23:21.920 --> 23:23.759
that you came to me for answers?

23:23.880 --> 23:24.880
Fifth Master...

23:26.559 --> 23:27.720
is gone.

23:37.079 --> 23:38.079
What did you say?

23:38.279 --> 23:39.440
There was heavy rain yesterday.

23:40.000 --> 23:41.319
The thatched hut was leaking badly.

23:41.960 --> 23:43.319
Master ordered us

23:43.440 --> 23:44.720
to cut wood in the mountains

23:45.079 --> 23:46.160
to repair the roof.

23:46.680 --> 23:48.200
We worked through the night.

23:49.119 --> 23:50.759
When we returned at dawn,

23:51.559 --> 23:52.960
the hut had already been

23:53.680 --> 23:55.759
burned to ashes.

23:56.400 --> 23:56.839
I...

23:56.839 --> 23:57.880
The villagers said

23:58.079 --> 23:59.079
that around midnight,

23:59.519 --> 24:01.039
they saw flames shooting into the sky.

24:01.440 --> 24:02.480
They called out for a long time,

24:03.079 --> 24:04.599
but no one answered.

24:06.079 --> 24:07.640
Didn't you just say

24:07.920 --> 24:09.079
there was heavy rain last night?

24:09.079 --> 24:10.240
The hut was soaked through!

24:10.400 --> 24:12.200
Then how did such a fire start?

24:12.519 --> 24:13.400
I...

24:13.559 --> 24:14.599
truly don't know.

24:14.799 --> 24:16.599
Seventh Young Master has already
taken the coffin home.

24:16.720 --> 24:19.079
There's no one left in the household
to take charge.

24:19.279 --> 24:20.079
Next,

24:20.440 --> 24:22.119
the death report, burial arrangements,
and all related procedures

24:22.279 --> 24:23.759
must be reported to the authorities.

24:24.079 --> 24:25.079
We can only beg you

24:25.160 --> 24:26.680
to take charge!

24:34.799 --> 24:36.640
Before Tingzhuo and his wife left,

24:38.519 --> 24:40.200
they left their personal seal with me.

24:40.839 --> 24:42.160
Get a visiting card prepared,

24:42.160 --> 24:43.680
and take it to the authorities
to report the death.

24:44.079 --> 24:46.079
I'll send word back to our family
in Huaying.

24:46.240 --> 24:47.559
Keep the funeral simple.

24:49.160 --> 24:51.119
I'll have the accountant prepare

24:52.000 --> 24:53.400
a list of the coffin specifications

24:53.799 --> 24:55.039
and burial clothes we need,

24:56.079 --> 24:57.440
and in an hour,

24:57.440 --> 24:58.559
I'll give it to you both.

24:59.960 --> 25:01.240
I'll also provide

25:02.240 --> 25:03.559
all the money you need.

25:03.720 --> 25:05.240
Thank you, Ninth Young Lady.

25:16.839 --> 25:18.960
You are willing to handle
his funeral arrangements,

25:19.400 --> 25:20.319
and this gesture

25:21.160 --> 25:23.160
is enough to repay the bond
of blood between you.

25:23.839 --> 25:25.880
If you don't have the strength
to handle everything,

25:26.880 --> 25:28.079
tell Mr. Zhao.

25:28.920 --> 25:30.480
Let him take care of it for you.

25:31.920 --> 25:32.880
Mr. Zhao...

25:41.240 --> 25:43.240
He didn't come home all night.

25:46.559 --> 25:48.480
He only returned early this morning.

26:42.119 --> 26:43.759
The Fu family sent word this morning.

26:44.960 --> 26:46.559
They said the hut caught fire.

26:48.000 --> 26:48.880
Father...

26:50.400 --> 26:51.559
didn't make it out.

26:55.319 --> 26:56.839
He had grown used to living
in that hut while mourning.

26:58.079 --> 26:59.079
With incense burning day and night,

27:01.160 --> 27:02.079
accidents could happen.

27:05.279 --> 27:06.720
Where were you

27:08.519 --> 27:09.920
last night?

27:12.400 --> 27:13.440
Were you at the yamen?

27:36.079 --> 27:38.839
I had already cut all ties with him.

27:40.839 --> 27:42.559
We had nothing to do with each other.

27:44.519 --> 27:46.759
Why did you still get involved with him?

27:48.880 --> 27:50.799
He is still my father.

27:53.079 --> 27:54.920
No matter how many reasons there were,

27:56.000 --> 27:57.920
you shouldn't have done this.

27:58.319 --> 28:00.400
Least of all, you.

28:21.920 --> 28:23.319
Fifth Master had committed grave sins.

28:27.720 --> 28:29.200
What happened with Ms. Li before

28:30.160 --> 28:31.920
was arranged by him and the Yu family.

28:32.480 --> 28:33.680
They colluded from within and without.

28:34.960 --> 28:36.240
Rather than guarding
against a thief every day,

28:37.440 --> 28:38.200
I thought it would be better...

29:16.680 --> 29:17.400
Quanhui,

29:27.720 --> 29:28.559
you resent me.

29:29.559 --> 29:31.480
I just can't understand...

29:35.839 --> 29:38.119
What reason did you have

29:40.680 --> 29:42.400
for crossing such a line?

29:51.039 --> 29:53.039
There were ten thousand reasons
not to kill him.

29:53.240 --> 29:54.880
But Mr. Zhao's reason for killing him

29:56.440 --> 29:58.440
was the ten-thousand-and-first.

29:58.440 --> 29:59.559
Why not tell her?

30:00.039 --> 30:01.039
If this continues,

30:01.279 --> 30:02.839
it will only drive a wedge between them.

30:04.880 --> 30:05.599
You tell her.

30:06.799 --> 30:07.599
No way.

30:07.880 --> 30:08.599
You do it.

30:09.880 --> 30:11.119
How could I?

30:11.599 --> 30:12.880
This concerns family ethics.

30:13.200 --> 30:14.680
If Madam Zhao finds out

30:15.079 --> 30:17.319
that her own father caused
her mother's death,

30:17.480 --> 30:18.000
then...

30:18.559 --> 30:19.559
My heavens,

30:20.079 --> 30:22.200
you might as well be asking
Mr. Zhao to rip out his own heart.

32:11.559 --> 32:13.559
(If you hadn't been so determined
to investigate those accounts,)

32:13.960 --> 32:14.960
(would your mother-in-law)

32:15.920 --> 32:18.960
(have died so suddenly?)

32:19.400 --> 32:20.599
(Today,)

32:21.039 --> 32:22.559
(you are willing to part
with your mother-in-law.)

32:23.559 --> 32:24.319
(Tomorrow,)

32:25.039 --> 32:26.640
(who else will you be willing
to part with?)

32:33.440 --> 32:34.440
(The Yu family...)

32:34.519 --> 32:36.559
(I'll make you pay for every drop
of blood you've shed.)

32:42.560 --> 32:44.600
(Xie Residence)

32:46.319 --> 32:47.079
Commander Zhao,

32:47.519 --> 32:49.000
what a pleasant mood you're in today.

32:49.240 --> 32:51.079
You went out of your way
to invite us here.

32:51.240 --> 32:52.200
Don't tell me

32:52.200 --> 32:53.559
it's just to watch fish.

32:53.880 --> 32:55.880
Lord Wei, don't underestimate
these ornamental carp.

32:57.160 --> 32:58.559
They may look ordinary,

33:00.079 --> 33:01.119
but they have quite a history.

33:02.920 --> 33:04.640
This one in particular
is quite impressive.

33:05.079 --> 33:05.960
Commander Zhao,

33:06.079 --> 33:07.440
what makes it so special?

33:07.640 --> 33:08.440
This fish

33:10.599 --> 33:11.839
came from Yongning Prefecture.

33:12.640 --> 33:14.319
Its lineage has long been tied
to noble families.

33:15.039 --> 33:15.960
One of its descendants

33:16.480 --> 33:18.279
was once kept in the Hanlin
Academy's pond.

33:19.000 --> 33:21.039
Now it has even taken on the prestige
of the Grand Secretariat.

33:23.440 --> 33:25.079
It is anything but ordinary.

33:25.960 --> 33:26.880
This fish

33:27.079 --> 33:28.759
has lived in the capital for years.

33:28.920 --> 33:29.680
And now,

33:29.799 --> 33:31.039
the entire pond

33:31.119 --> 33:32.519
belongs to it.

33:33.880 --> 33:34.960
Look around it.

33:35.400 --> 33:36.880
All its followers gather around it,
don't they?

33:37.599 --> 33:38.759
But this fish

33:39.680 --> 33:41.279
feeds only on lotus stems.

33:43.440 --> 33:45.319
If we wish to preserve
this pond of blossoms,

33:47.200 --> 33:49.079
it must be removed.

33:54.920 --> 33:56.039
The question is,

33:56.960 --> 33:58.559
whether you gentlemen are willing
to lend me a hand.

33:59.160 --> 34:01.440
Help me build a new pond today,

34:02.519 --> 34:03.880
and when we harvest
the lotus seeds in the future,

34:07.240 --> 34:09.039
I will be sure to share them with you.

34:18.480 --> 34:20.079
I've loved lotus flowers
since childhood.

34:20.119 --> 34:22.159
I've long had enough of this greedy fish

34:22.159 --> 34:23.679
that has ruined the entire pond.

34:24.599 --> 34:26.079
Hearing that from you, Commander Zhao,

34:26.559 --> 34:28.199
I feel much more at ease.

34:29.239 --> 34:29.719
Come here.

34:34.079 --> 34:35.079
I'll lend you my support.

34:38.320 --> 34:38.920
I...

34:39.159 --> 34:40.159
I'll help you as well.

34:41.679 --> 34:42.400
Commander Zhao,

34:42.760 --> 34:43.559
you have my support too.

34:43.559 --> 34:44.280
Mine as well.

34:44.280 --> 34:45.480
I'm willing to assist you,
Commander Zhao.

34:50.199 --> 34:51.039
Commander Zhao,

34:51.239 --> 34:52.239
you know me well.

34:52.679 --> 34:53.920
Whether it is

34:53.920 --> 34:54.840
helping you catch the fish,

34:54.960 --> 34:56.280
or taking your lotus seeds,

34:56.679 --> 34:57.480
I still need

34:57.719 --> 34:58.400
to go back

34:58.400 --> 34:59.559
and seek approval first.

35:01.320 --> 35:02.159
Lord Wei...

35:31.440 --> 35:33.680
(Prayers offered for Fu Shichang's
peaceful rebirth.)

35:36.159 --> 35:37.440
A man like Fifth Master Fu...

35:37.960 --> 35:39.440
when it came to raising children,

35:39.440 --> 35:41.800
only did his part for a brief moment.

35:43.000 --> 35:44.280
The nurturing and upbringing

35:44.840 --> 35:46.840
were all handled by Fifth Madam alone.

35:47.079 --> 35:48.000
In the end,

35:48.239 --> 35:50.079
this seven-day Buddhist memorial service

35:50.239 --> 35:51.280
has finally settled

35:51.280 --> 35:52.800
the bond between you and him.

35:53.719 --> 35:55.599
It's a pity he left so suddenly.

35:55.920 --> 35:56.840
Fifth Madam

35:57.599 --> 35:58.880
would probably still blame him even now.

35:59.960 --> 36:01.639
He and my mother were never
on the same path.

36:02.159 --> 36:03.679
They will not meet again
in the afterlife.

36:16.119 --> 36:16.840
Do we

36:16.840 --> 36:17.880
have guests?

36:17.880 --> 36:19.079
Mr. Zhao has guests today.

36:19.280 --> 36:20.599
We didn't expect you back so soon,

36:20.679 --> 36:21.400
so he didn't say anything.

36:23.000 --> 36:24.079
Who are the guests?

36:24.719 --> 36:25.920
Lord Wei from the Ministry of Personnel,

36:26.119 --> 36:27.079
and Lord Zhu from the Ministry
of Revenue.

36:32.639 --> 36:34.079
If word gets out

36:34.880 --> 36:36.039
about what you did today,

36:37.480 --> 36:38.960
you'll be accused of forming a faction.

36:39.440 --> 36:40.599
The Yu family has tremendous power.

36:42.079 --> 36:43.079
One cannot stand against such power.

36:44.760 --> 36:45.719
There was no other choice.

36:47.159 --> 36:49.239
But why rush into it now?

36:50.280 --> 36:51.280
There are things

36:52.599 --> 36:53.920
Grand Secretary Yu can do,

36:54.800 --> 36:55.719
but you cannot.

36:57.440 --> 36:58.840
Take forming factions, for example.

36:59.760 --> 37:00.559
These people

37:01.079 --> 37:03.000
may throw stones at you
in this pavilion today,

37:03.840 --> 37:04.559
but tomorrow,

37:05.679 --> 37:08.199
they'll throw blades at you
in the court.

37:11.400 --> 37:12.880
You hold a high position now.

37:13.960 --> 37:15.920
Why not learn from Grand Secretary Tian?

37:18.599 --> 37:19.400
Today,

37:22.559 --> 37:23.519
where did you go?

37:31.039 --> 37:32.079
I smell sandalwood.

37:34.760 --> 37:35.679
You went to the temple?

37:38.920 --> 37:40.239
At Tanshui Temple,

37:42.639 --> 37:44.039
I prayed to cleanse away obstacles
and seek blessings.

37:45.079 --> 37:47.000
You arranged a Buddhist memorial
service for Fifth Master Fu?

37:51.840 --> 37:53.559
I didn't do it only for him.

37:55.920 --> 37:57.320
I did it for you.

38:00.000 --> 38:00.800
Mr. Zhao.

38:02.079 --> 38:04.079
I don't think I understand you anymore.

38:08.559 --> 38:09.760
Do you think

38:10.599 --> 38:11.639
I'm beyond forgiveness?

38:15.400 --> 38:17.079
You took the blame

38:18.880 --> 38:20.039
for him.

38:23.920 --> 38:26.119
A prudent man
does not put himself in harm's way.

38:26.800 --> 38:27.559
Mr. Zhao,

38:28.719 --> 38:30.079
there's a raging fire ahead.

38:30.840 --> 38:32.719
Rushing straight into it
may feel satisfying,

38:33.519 --> 38:35.079
but you could destroy yourself.

38:36.079 --> 38:38.199
We've come so far to get
where we are today.

38:38.880 --> 38:40.440
Why must you rush this?

38:41.559 --> 38:42.199
Could you...

38:43.280 --> 38:44.960
Could you take a more measured approach?

38:47.599 --> 38:48.960
Please, do it for my sake.

38:55.639 --> 38:56.679
There's no time.

38:58.119 --> 39:00.079
Grand Secretary Yu and I are already
locked in a fight to the bitter end.

39:01.400 --> 39:02.880
I cannot back down now.

39:07.000 --> 39:08.039
Why?

39:09.159 --> 39:10.719
Back in Linchun Town,

39:10.719 --> 39:11.840
you listened to me.

39:12.519 --> 39:14.079
Even though officials and merchants
walk different paths,

39:14.480 --> 39:16.480
you still chose to investigate
the case with me.

39:17.079 --> 39:18.559
And in Yongning Prefecture,

39:19.199 --> 39:20.760
you listened to me then too.

39:21.920 --> 39:23.840
Even when you wanted nothing
more than a quiet life,

39:24.679 --> 39:26.199
you still chose to join the army.

39:27.559 --> 39:30.079
So why now, when I'm only asking you
to slow down,

39:31.480 --> 39:32.960
can you no longer listen to me?

39:37.760 --> 39:38.559
Quanhui.

39:40.639 --> 39:42.440
Court battles may not spill blood,

39:44.079 --> 39:46.440
but they are far more dangerous
than wars at the border.

39:48.679 --> 39:50.159
Everything depends on this.

39:51.599 --> 39:52.760
I have to win.

39:55.280 --> 39:56.679
Only then can I protect everyone.

39:59.840 --> 40:01.039
Only then can I keep you safe.

40:10.440 --> 40:12.320
But I want to protect you too.

40:19.560 --> 40:22.000
(Next Episode)

40:22.159 --> 40:23.039
The Northwest

40:23.800 --> 40:24.920
is where Mr. Zhao comes from.

40:25.079 --> 40:26.239
I simply cannot

40:26.400 --> 40:27.719
stand by and watch him fight alone.

40:27.719 --> 40:29.039
He couldn't have pulled off

40:29.039 --> 40:30.400
something this flawless on his own.

40:31.000 --> 40:32.599
I only hope this bloodstained garment

40:33.039 --> 40:34.519
will finally see the light of day.

40:35.119 --> 40:36.639
You are a Grand Secretary of the court.

40:37.280 --> 40:38.599
How could you commit

40:38.599 --> 40:39.840
such a violation of human decency?

40:39.840 --> 40:40.840
Insolence!

40:41.639 --> 40:43.159
This is clearly a frame-up.

40:43.159 --> 40:43.920
Commander Zhao

40:44.159 --> 40:45.079
is simply trying

40:45.480 --> 40:46.599
to take revenge.

40:47.400 --> 40:49.039
If you insist on fighting head-on,

40:49.480 --> 40:51.320
you'll be the egg that cracks.

41:04.520 --> 41:08.840
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

41:12.440 --> 41:16.800
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

41:18.920 --> 41:23.560
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

41:23.800 --> 41:26.600
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

41:27.760 --> 41:32.400
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

41:35.600 --> 41:42.440
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

41:43.320 --> 41:49.840
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

41:50.800 --> 41:54.240
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

41:54.760 --> 41:58.960
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

41:59.240 --> 42:04.920
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

42:17.040 --> 42:20.920
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

42:24.840 --> 42:28.840
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

42:30.560 --> 42:35.240
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

42:35.560 --> 42:38.240
♪Kept close within my heart♪

42:39.320 --> 42:44.160
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

42:47.680 --> 42:54.600
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

42:55.480 --> 43:01.960
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

43:02.840 --> 43:06.360
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

43:06.800 --> 43:11.160
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

43:11.360 --> 43:17.080
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
